WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.830 line:74% align:center
Hello, I'm Ilaria Mari, I'm a dentist,

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.830 line:74% align:center
and I practice in Spoleto, in the province of Perugia,

3
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:12.830 line:74% align:center
and I have a dental practice we moved into around 2013,

4
00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:14.830 line:74% align:center
so a relatively new practice.

5
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:19.830 line:74% align:center
But I had some problems, because as we lived in the space

6
00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.830 line:74% align:center
we realized there were difficulties,

7
00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.830 line:74% align:center
which increased with Covid.

8
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.830 line:74% align:center
The first was that we had a very large space,

9
00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:31.830 line:74% align:center
a terrace that wasn't used at all,

10
00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.830 line:74% align:center
and this terrace was simply a place where couriers dropped off their packages

11
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.830 line:74% align:center
but it wasn't enjoyed at all, by either patients or staff.

12
00:00:40.880 --> 00:00:46.830 line:74% align:center
With Covid, having this large unused space

13
00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:49.830 line:74% align:center
was even more of a handicap for the practice.

14
00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:54.830 line:74% align:center
In addition, this is a practice mainly for child patients,

15
00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.830 line:74% align:center
and so I wanted to bring the structure of the practice closer

16
00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.830 line:74% align:center
to an environment more suited to young patients,

17
00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:07.830 line:74% align:center
one that could convey a feeling of calm right from the start.

18
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:10.830 line:74% align:center
It may sound ironic, since we're talking about the dentist,

19
00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:15.830 line:74% align:center
but I really wanted the practice to give off a feeling,

20
00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:17.830 line:74% align:center
an oasis of tranquility,

21
00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.830 line:74% align:center
an emotion that would accompany them through the various rooms

22
00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.830 line:74% align:center
and make them feel calm and safe,

23
00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.830 line:74% align:center
in an environment they should never have to enter

24
00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.830 line:74% align:center
either unwillingly or frightened.

25
00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.830 line:74% align:center
When I met Sartoretto Verna

26
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:34.830 line:74% align:center
I listed and explained what the

27
00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.830 line:74% align:center
critical points of the practice were. Another critical point

28
00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:42.830 line:74% align:center
was that we had no wall cabinets in the operating areas,

29
00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:46.830 line:74% align:center
so a pile of machines and instruments was in plain view,

30
00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:50.830 line:74% align:center
which could themselves evoke a sense of unease,

31
00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.830 line:74% align:center
whereas I wanted a cleaner, more streamlined environment,

32
00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.830 line:74% align:center
where the instruments and machines that could cause unease

33
00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:01.830 line:74% align:center
were not put on display.

34
00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.830 line:74% align:center
When I met Sartoretto Verna

35
00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.830 line:74% align:center
I listed the weak points

36
00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:08.830 line:74% align:center
of the practice where I was working,

37
00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:10.830 line:74% align:center
even though it was a new practice

38
00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:13.830 line:74% align:center
and also aesthetically pleasant.

39
00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.830 line:74% align:center
It was a very, very fruitful conversation,

40
00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.830 line:74% align:center
because they were also able to ask me the right questions

41
00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:23.830 line:74% align:center
to really draw out my goals,

42
00:02:23.880 --> 00:02:27.830 line:74% align:center
what I expected from this project.

43
00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.830 line:74% align:center
And when, in August 2020, I was called

44
00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:34.830 line:74% align:center
for the project presentation,

45
00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:38.830 line:74% align:center
I was stunned to see a rendering

46
00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.830 line:74% align:center
that was exactly the 3D realization

47
00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:44.830 line:74% align:center
of what I had always told them I wanted.

48
00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.830 line:74% align:center
And so, however daunting

49
00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:49.830 line:74% align:center
a renovation can be,

50
00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:52.830 line:74% align:center
especially while you're still working

51
00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.830 line:74% align:center
inside the same premises,

52
00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.830 line:74% align:center
I threw myself into this adventure,

53
00:02:57.880 --> 00:03:00.830 line:74% align:center
because the firm was not only skilled

54
00:03:00.880 --> 00:03:04.830 line:74% align:center
at interpreting the needs I had expressed,

55
00:03:04.880 --> 00:03:08.830 line:74% align:center
but also at reassuring me that all the work would be

56
00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.830 line:74% align:center
managed as painlessly as possible,

57
00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:14.830 line:74% align:center
and they kept their promise, because the firm

58
00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:17.830 line:74% align:center
also took care to introduce me to the contractor

59
00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.830 line:74% align:center
who would carry out all the work.

60
00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:22.830 line:74% align:center
From a practical standpoint,

61
00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:25.830 line:74% align:center
deadlines were met,

62
00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.830 line:74% align:center
and even when there were small unexpected issues,

63
00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.830 line:74% align:center
as always happens

64
00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:32.830 line:74% align:center
in major works,

65
00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.830 line:74% align:center
they were always handled in the calmest

66
00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:38.830 line:74% align:center
and most serene way possible, and everyone found a solution.

67
00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:42.830 line:74% align:center
So the interaction throughout this adventure

68
00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:44.830 line:74% align:center
together was extremely positive.

69
00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.830 line:74% align:center
Today I'm here to present

70
00:03:47.880 --> 00:03:50.830 line:74% align:center
the final result of this work,

71
00:03:50.880 --> 00:03:53.830 line:74% align:center
and it's a practice that I like very much,

72
00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.830 line:74% align:center
that my employees like very much,

73
00:03:55.880 --> 00:03:58.830 line:74% align:center
who are much happier to come to work in an environment

74
00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.830 line:74% align:center
that definitely makes them feel much more at ease

75
00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:05.830 line:74% align:center
and much more comfortable.

76
00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.830 line:74% align:center
And above all, my patients like it,

77
00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:09.830 line:74% align:center
both adults and children.

78
00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.830 line:74% align:center
Adults, too, have really appreciated

79
00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:15.830 line:74% align:center
the natural theme that runs throughout the practice,

80
00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:17.830 line:74% align:center
both inside and outside,

81
00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:20.830 line:74% align:center
and every day they compliment me

82
00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.830 line:74% align:center
because, quite simply, they feel at ease here.
